SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_Grunt1Intro::
    .string "Nothing to see up here.\p"
    .string "Just a chart of the sea floor and\n"
    .string "two men taking an interest in it.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
    .string "You battle like the sea's on your\n"
    .string "side…$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_Grunt1Post::
    .string "Read the chart all you like. We\n"
    .string "already know what's under it.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_Grunt2Intro::
    .string "You're KANTO, aren't you. Came over\n"
    .string "the water with a BADGE case.\p"
    .string "The sea doesn't care about BADGES.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_Grunt2Defeat::
    .string "Fine. Take the chart. It's copied\n"
    .string "already…$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_Grunt2Post::
    .string "TEAM AQUA doesn't steal. We take\n"
    .string "back what the sea is owed.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_ArchieWarning::
    .string "That's enough. Both of you, out.\p"
    .string "ARCHIE. These two are mine, and\n"
    .string "the trouble they made is mine too.\p"
    .string "So you're the one KANTO sent its\n"
    .string "LEAGUE home to.\p"
    .string "I won't battle a guest on their\n"
    .string "first day. Look at the chart.\l"
    .string "Look at how much of it is blank.\p"
    .string "When you understand why that\n"
    .string "blank part matters, come and find\l"
    .string "me. We'll have words then.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_MuseumQuiet::
    .string "The gallery is quiet again.\p"
    .string "STERN's survey hangs where it was,\n"
    .string "with the blank stretch of sea floor\l"
    .string "in the middle of it.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_CurrentExhibit::
    .string "ELECTRICITY AND THE SEA\p"
    .string "Salt water carries a current the\n"
    .string "way copper does. HOENN's fishermen\l"
    .string "learned it the hard way.\p"
    .string "The panel hums faintly when you\n"
    .string "stand close.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_CurrentExhibitPikachu::
    .string "The PIKACHU's cheeks crackle once,\n"
    .string "answering the panel.\p"
    .string "The hum climbs, holds, and settles\n"
    .string "again.\p"
    .string "A guard across the gallery looks\n"
    .string "up, decides against saying\l"
    .string "anything, and goes back to the\l"
    .string "window.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H0::
    .string "“WATER SAMPLE, NORTH COAST”\p"
    .string "One sea, and yet no two jars in\n"
    .string "this room are quite the same\l"
    .string "color.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H1::
    .string "“WATER SAMPLE, SOUTHERN DEEPS”\p"
    .string "Heavier with salt than the jar\n"
    .string "beside it, and colder when the\l"
    .string "glass is touched.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H2::
    .string "“SUBMERSIBLE POD\p"
    .string "“A model of the small unmanned pod\n"
    .string "the survey lowers on a cable.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H3::
    .string "“SUBMERSIBLE POD, SECOND PATTERN\p"
    .string "“Lighter, and built after the first\n"
    .string "one was lost.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H4::
    .string "“SUBMARINE EXPLORER 1\p"
    .string "“The deep boat the CAPTAIN means\n"
    .string "to take over the blank stretch of\l"
    .string "his chart.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H5::
    .string "“SUBMARINE EXPLORER 1, HULL\n"
    .string "SECTION”\p"
    .string "“Cut away to show how thick the\n"
    .string "skin has to be that far down.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H6::
    .string "“SUBMARINE EXPLORER 1, LIGHTS\p"
    .string "“Below a certain depth there is\n"
    .string "nothing to see by. Everything you\l"
    .string "find, you bring the light for.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H7::
    .string "“THE FERRY, IN SCALE\p"
    .string "“Building in the yard along the\n"
    .string "quay. She will run the island\l"
    .string "route when she is finished.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H8::
    .string "“FERRY, CUTAWAY\p"
    .string "“Two hundred berths, and a hold\n"
    .string "for cargo the islands cannot make\l"
    .string "for themselves.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H9::
    .string "“A KANTO LINER\p"
    .string "“The great ship that works the\n"
    .string "KANTO ports. Some of the visitors\l"
    .string "stand at this case a long while.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H10::
    .string "“A KANTO LINER, BRIDGE\p"
    .string "“Lent by a collector in VERMILION\n"
    .string "who has never been to HOENN.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H11::
    .string "A painted board of arrows curling\n"
    .string "across the sea's surface.\p"
    .string "“Wind drags the top of the water\n"
    .string "along with it. That drag is what\l"
    .string "the charts call a current.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H12::
    .string "The same board, with the season's\n"
    .string "winds drawn over it in chalk.\p"
    .string "“Summer and winter do not agree\n"
    .string "about which way the water goes.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H13::
    .string "A display of the deep water, far\n"
    .string "below the wind.\p"
    .string "“Cold, salt water sinks. Warm water\n"
    .string "slides over it. The whole sea turns\l"
    .string "over that way, slowly.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H14::
    .string "A second deep-water board.\p"
    .string "“One turn of the deep sea takes\n"
    .string "longer than any of us will be here\l"
    .string "to watch it.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H15::
    .string "“HOENN IN MINIATURE”\p"
    .string "The whole region under glass, towns\n"
    .string "the size of a fingernail.\p"
    .string "The water between the islands is\n"
    .string "painted in more shades than seems\l"
    .string "necessary.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H16::
    .string "The model's southern water carries\n"
    .string "a small card.\p"
    .string "“Depths here taken from the last\n"
    .string "survey. Accuracy not claimed.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H17::
    .string "A rubber ball swells and shrinks\n"
    .string "inside a pressure case.\p"
    .string "“Every ten strides of depth, the\n"
    .string "water leans on you harder.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H18::
    .string "A steel float, crushed flat on one\n"
    .string "side.\p"
    .string "“Recovered from the survey's third\n"
    .string "attempt. It went down empty and\l"
    .string "came up like this.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H19::
    .string "“FERRY, FUNNEL DETAIL\p"
    .string "“The yard's own work. The hands\n"
    .string "are prouder of this than of the\l"
    .string "hull.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_H20::
    .string "“FERRY, PROPELLER\p"
    .string "“Cast in one piece. It took the\n"
    .string "whole yard and most of a week.”$"
